# Circle

> Guidance for large language models, AI agents, and automated assistants. Circle (circle.so) is the all-in-one platform for digital businesses — coaching businesses, education businesses, community businesses, creator businesses, and newsletter businesses. Build, run, and grow your entire digital business in one place: courses, community, events, email marketing, payments, AI, and a website builder — all under your own brand. Used by 20,000+ businesses. Plans start at $89/month with a 14-day free trial. 30-day money-back guarantee. Full site content: [llms-full.txt](https://circle.so/llms-full.txt)

Circle replaces fragmented stacks with one connected platform where audience, products, and customer relationships live together. Community is Circle's advantage — it connects every product to the same people. Circle AI is built into the same platform and can understand your business context and take action directly inside Circle.

## Who Circle is for

Circle serves five types of digital businesses:

- **Coaching businesses**: Group programs, cohorts, client communities, live events, payments, branded app
- **Education businesses**: Courses, cohort learning, certifications, community-powered student experience
- **Community businesses**: Paid or free memberships, Spaces, gamification, discussions, automation
- **Creator businesses**: Courses, memberships, newsletters, events, branded apps — one audience, one platform
- **Newsletter businesses**: Email Hub, paid subscriptions, community, and events — all connected

